   "field_name": "Headline",
   "text": "Pump More Easily & Efficiently",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdOb1fOj/Headline"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "Pump More Easily & Efficiently | {KeyWord:pump for low milk supply} | Cozy Power By Momcozy | Momcozy® Official | Momcozy® With Moms Always | Momcozy Official | {KeyWord:best breast pump} | {KeyWord:increase breast milk supply} | Breast Pumps for Milk Supply | Top Pumps for More Milk | Best Breast Pumps Reviewed | Pumps for Better Milk Flow | Milk Supply Pump Comparison | Find the Right Breast Pump | {KeyWord:increase milk supply} | Discover 8 best breast pumps to help increase milk supply—expert tips & reviews. | Learn which pumps boost milk production and why they work — guide & comparisons. | Top pump recommendations to support milk supply for frequent pumping moms. | Compare pumps built to help increase output — features, tips & reviews.",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdOb1fOj/Primary Text"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "修改建议",
   "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 奶流/移除量/排空效率/漏奶/短时排乳类claim需W1自身对照数据（样本、对照、统计口径齐全），或改为放松叙事+限定语（may help/natural）；内部测试数值（28.2%/10%/70%）补齐前不得公开传播",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdOb1fOj/修改建议"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "命中原因",
   "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；M07 效率/漏奶/奶流/移除量/短时排乳类claim需W1自身对照数据（当前仅内部测试或外部研究，28.2%/10%/70%待补样本与统计），或限定为放松叙事；未补证据前需限定或删除",
